--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
static_assert condition could not be evaluated
--
A constexpr function that reads a namespace-scope `const int' could not be
evaluated, so its call was rejected as a template argument ("expected
constant expression") and a static_assert using it was not checked.
